                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The chemical reaction is a key electrophilic substitution reaction. The nucleophile attacks the carbon atom, displacing the leaving group (Br), opposite to the leaving group. This backside attack results in a Walden inversion of stereochemical configuration.",
