                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "LTKNk",
                      "name": "TS Text",
                      "fill": "#2d2a26",
                      "content": "At the peak of the reaction coordinate, the carbon forms a pentacoordinate transition state. The carbon is sp2 hybridized, and the nucleophile and leaving group are partially bonded along a linear axis.",
