                  "fill": "#2d2a26",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The Folio theme uses a clean, editorial aesthetic inspired by scientific journals and textbook prints. It relies on high contrast serif titles (Fraunces) and legible sans-serif UI elements (Plus Jakarta Sans) for data density.",
