                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "- XL (200x220): Goal planning stack anchors\n- L (200x168): Curriculum roadmap objectives\n- M (184x112): Default gateway gateways\n- S (148x80): Compact topic highlights\n- XS (112x44): Smallest punctuation pins",
